msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Not much to it.  I worked here as a logger before <the_cataclysm> began.  "
"When all went to hell, I was on the job and had to hole up here with my "
"coworkers.  Good news is we all came out fine, and the boss decided to keep "
"the mill running.  I don't know how much longer we can last, though; not "
"unless we make some contact with other people.  Customers, I guess you might "
"call 'em."
msgstr ""

