msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/militia/GM_Militia_Merchant.json
msgid ""
"Welcome to our camp.  Behave yourself while you are here.  What can I do for "
"you?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/militia/GM_Militia_Merchant.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/Salvor_Market/uica_vehicle_marchant_talk.json
msgid "What do you do here?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/militia/GM_Militia_Merchant.json
msgid "What's the story behind this place?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/militia/GM_Militia_Merchant.json
msgid "Time for me to leave"
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/militia/GM_Militia_Merchant.json
msgid ""
"I'm the most senior member at this point so I'm what passes for the leader "
"here now.  I'm just trying to make plans to keep us alive since everything "
"fell apart."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/militia/GM_Militia_Merchant.json
msgid ""
"Well, that's a long story.  We are what's left of the Grey Moose militia.  We"
" had plans for when things went south cause of crazy politicians or war, but "
"we didn't expect people to go crazy then turn zombie.  Only a handful of our "
"members actually made it through all that madness.  What's worse is that we "
"lost so much of our supplies and gear due to military checkpoints and trigger"
" happy soldiers.  It didn't matter that half of us were former military the "
"checkpoint guards just saw weapons, panicked and then confiscated everything "
"but the clothes on our back.  So here we are at our planned escape location "
"with not even a fraction of our manpower or supplies."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/militia/GM_Militia_Merchant.json
msgid ""
"I can't say I can think of anything at the moment.  Our remoteness is our "
"defense.  We want to keep a low profile and try to keep out of any trouble in"
" this isolated location.  We are willing to trade for weapons and ammo "
"though.  Keeping the nearby area clear and hunting is always eating away at "
"our supplies."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/militia/GM_Militia_Merchant.json
msgid "Keeping a low profile is good."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/militia/GM_Militia_Merchant.json
msgid "Stay safe out there.  Not enough of us are around anymore."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
